## Future Optimization

The current solution is "pure recursion", so many `(n, target)` states are calculated repeatedly.

For example, the same state:

"text
(n=1, target=6)
"

can be reached through multiple paths.

The next optimization is "memoization / DP", where we store:

"text
(n, target) → minimum coins
"

so that the same state doesn't need to be calculated again.
